  "metadata": {
    "name": "nr-airtoxics-lawn-garden-county",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.5 step 7e: the `nr-airtoxics-lawn-garden-county` RunSpec computed from the DEFAULT DATABASE -- `nr-lawn-garden-county`'s geography, time and equipment exactly (Washtenaw County, August 2020, weekday, the Lawn/Garden sector, gasoline) with a different POLLUTANT SET: 29 running-exhaust pollutant-processes, which reach NRHCSpeciationCalculator's five hydrocarbon species, NRAirToxicsCalculator's twenty toxics and its NonHAPTOG pass, besides THC, PM10, PM2.5 and fuel consumption. The twelfth and last nonroad rung. 97 equipment points over 31 SCCs, 484 cohorts, 14,036 rows.\n\nNONROAD's needed set is its selection (`flagRequiredPollutantProcesses` returns early for it), which is why the RunSpec names every link of the chain. THC and PM10 are `nr-lawn-garden-county`'s to the last digit in both snapshots, so everything below the speciation line is that run's."
  },
